@startuml Linkwise_Session_Sequence
!theme plain
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName "Latin Modern Roman"
skinparam defaultFontSize 10
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam ArrowColor #2A9D8F
hide footbox
participant "ChatGPT Agent / Codex" as AI
participant "MCP adapter" as MCP
participant "Station execution" as APP
participant "Local policy" as POLICY
AI -> MCP: link_prepare_candidate
MCP -> APP: typed preparation
APP -> APP: lease / configure / readback
APP --> MCP: handle / revision / expiry
MCP --> AI: prepared result
AI -> MCP: link_request_session_authorization
MCP -> APP: typed authorization request
APP -> POLICY: validate installed authority and state
POLICY --> APP: bounded grant / denial
APP --> MCP: grant / expiry / policy revision
MCP --> AI: authorization result
note over APP,POLICY
 Automatic local authorization within installed limits.
 Handles do not authorize later configuration changes.
end note
@enduml
